//! Stable, machine-readable candidate snapshots of the Rust scheduler decisions.
//!
//! These records are generated by this port against a pinned upstream VkFFT commit; they
//! are not upstream goldens by themselves. An external upstream harness can emit the same
//! schema and [`compare_upstream_scheduler_snapshot_jsonl`] validates that reference by
//! case key, schema version, commit, kind, and scheduler fields.
//!
//! This module deliberately serializes and compares without serde so the validation/report
//! surface does not add a runtime dependency. The JSONL schema is versioned independently
//! of the Rust structs and always carries the fixed upstream VkFFT commit used by this port.

